## Prompt

```text
Correct ONLY the neutral panel's bottom caption/icon in this already corrected German polymer image. The neutral conjugated polymer is weakly conducting/semiconducting, so absolute 'Keine freien Ladungsträger' is misleading. Replace that caption with large clear TWO-LINE words 'Wenige mobile' / 'Träger'. Remove the red X icon and replace with a small neutral illustration of a few separated carriers, no absolute absence symbol. Keep ALL other content, especially right-panel electric field E→, Löcher→, Elektronen←, opposite arrows, battery polarity, and center oxidation/reduction diagrams unchanged. Do not add tiny footnotes or otherwise redesign.
```

